abstract: >-
  Thirty-three executable notebooks, each built on a live U.S. federal or
  institutional data source, each holding one methodological lesson about what
  that source permits a reader to conclude. Every retrieval is pinned by digest;
  every figure in the prose is checked against stored output; the failures found
  during the build are published alongside the results.
